{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hancui-e-fdc8530ea0ec89965388","title":"高柔鞫焦子文杀窦礼复盈母子平民","accounts":[{"id":"hancui-a-fdc8530ea0ec89965388","label":"正文","text":"高柔鞫焦子文杀窦礼复盈母子平民","evidence":["hancui-q-0613e784bc817f5af86e","hancui-q-4652f6d58987ecea2580","hancui-q-f405fc618c6c40b63ae7","hancui-q-e9f896cd8cdf74b17b05","hancui-q-a2260fad91609f833e0c"]}],"participants":[{"person":"hancui-p-739a076f933ebb","role":"出营未归；被杀","evidence":["hancui-q-0613e784bc817f5af86e","hancui-q-4652f6d58987ecea2580","hancui-q-f405fc618c6c40b63ae7","hancui-q-e9f896cd8cdf74b17b05","hancui-q-a2260fad91609f833e0c"]},{"person":"hancui-p-d7a960fd2ea606","role":"没官申冤；答问；复为平民","evidence":["hancui-q-0613e784bc817f5af86e","hancui-q-4652f6d58987ecea2580","hancui-q-f405fc618c6c40b63ae7","hancui-q-e9f896cd8cdf74b17b05","hancui-q-a2260fad91609f833e0c"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0017","role":"询问；审讯掘尸","evidence":["hancui-q-0613e784bc817f5af86e","hancui-q-4652f6d58987ecea2580","hancui-q-f405fc618c6c40b63ae7","hancui-q-e9f896cd8cdf74b17b05","hancui-q-a2260fad91609f833e0c"]},{"person":"hancui-p-442825519df641","role":"供认杀人","evidence":["hancui-q-0613e784bc817f5af86e","hancui-q-4652f6d58987ecea2580","hancui-q-f405fc618c6c40b63ae7","hancui-q-e9f896cd8cdf74b17b05","hancui-q-a2260fad91609f833e0c"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hancui-q-0613e784bc817f5af86e","hancui-q-4652f6d58987ecea2580","hancui-q-f405fc618c6c40b63ae7","hancui-q-e9f896cd8cdf74b17b05","hancui-q-a2260fad91609f833e0c"]},"ordering_evidence":"hancui-q-0613e784bc817f5af86e","order":4969}],"persons":[{"id":"hancui-p-739a076f933ebb","name":"窦礼","evidence":["hancui-q-0613e784bc817f5af86e","hancui-q-4652f6d58987ecea2580","hancui-q-f405fc618c6c40b63ae7","hancui-q-e9f896cd8cdf74b17b05","hancui-q-a2260fad91609f833e0c"],"facts":[],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hancui-q-0613e784bc817f5af86e","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-b6c9783a8ee3f3a83898","layer":"original","quote":"顷之，护军营士窦礼近出不还〖14〗。营以为亡〖15〗，表言逐捕，没其妻盈及男女为官奴婢〖16〗。盈连至州府，称冤自讼〖17〗，莫有省者〖18〗。乃辞诣廷尉。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":286,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-4652f6d58987ecea2580","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-40551639813b5a232045","layer":"original","quote":"柔问曰：“汝何以知夫不亡？”盈垂泣对曰：“夫少单特〖19〗，养一老妪为母，事甚恭谨；又哀儿女，抚视不离：非是轻狡不顾室家者也。”","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":287,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-a2260fad91609f833e0c","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-28061889a444f2350a30","layer":"original","quote":"诏书“复盈母子为平民〖28〗。班下天下〖29〗，以礼为戒〖30〗。”","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":290,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-e9f896cd8cdf74b17b05","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-ee638fb58967464474a6","layer":"original","quote":"时子文适坐小事系狱〖21〗；柔乃见子文，问所坐。言次〖22〗，曰：“汝颇曾举人钱不〖23〗？”子文曰：“自以单贫，初不敢举人钱物也〖24〗。”柔察子文色动〖25〗，遂曰：“汝昔举窦礼钱，何言不邪？”子文怪知事露，应对不次〖26〗。柔曰：“汝已杀礼，便宜早服！”子文于是叩头，具首杀礼本末〖27〗，埋藏处所。柔便遣吏卒，承子文辞往掘礼，即得其尸。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":289,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":172,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-f405fc618c6c40b63ae7","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-e3629b14aeb9fdf7d986","layer":"original","quote":"柔重问曰：“汝夫不与人有怨仇乎？”对曰：“夫良善，与人无仇。”又曰：“汝夫不与人交钱财乎？”对曰：“尝出钱与同营士焦子文〖20〗， 〔久〕 求不得。”","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":288,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
